---
name: Sysmon NXLog JSON → canonical event → OCSF
description: |
  Canonicalize structured NXLog JSON before mapping the Windows Event Log
  record to OCSF.
---

from_file "sysmon-nxlog.ndjson" {
  read_ndjson unflatten_separator="."
}
// The canonicalizer recognizes NXLog's `im_msvistalog` source and delegates
// the structured record to the NXLog adapter.
sysmon::canonicalize this, sysmon
sysmon::ocsf::map sysmon, ocsf
ocsf.metadata.log_format = "json"
this = move ocsf
ocsf_derive
ocsf_cast
